BYTE RELAY COMMISSIONING CONTRACT REGISTRY  (slice DATA; the machinery is generic)
Authority for every externally constrained backend: REFERENCE-AUTHORITY.md / IMPLEMENTATION-CONTRACTS.md.
Only CPU_WASM64 and WEBGPU carry READY-CONTRACT here; every other family of G is present with status GAP so that
target preservation (PASS1 section 6, CAPABILITY-MATRIX.md) is data-visible, not a compiler assumption.

@{registry byte_relay_commissioning version=1}

--- representations (REPRESENTATION-TRANSFER.md) ---
@{representation HOST_BYTES type=Bytes domain=ARRAY_BUFFER modes=copy,move,borrow lifetime=host_scope}
@{representation WASM_LINEAR_BYTES type=Bytes domain=WASM_LINEAR modes=copy,borrow lifetime=instance}
@{representation GPU_BUFFER_BYTES type=Bytes domain=GPU_BUFFER modes=copy lifetime=device}
@{boundary Bytes HOST_BYTES}

--- explicit conversions (no implicit conversion exists) ---
@{conversion host_to_wasm HOST_BYTES -> WASM_LINEAR_BYTES mode=copy preserves=value requires=CPU_WASM64}
@{conversion wasm_to_host WASM_LINEAR_BYTES -> HOST_BYTES mode=copy preserves=value requires=CPU_WASM64}
@{conversion host_to_gpu HOST_BYTES -> GPU_BUFFER_BYTES mode=copy preserves=value requires=WEBGPU}
@{conversion gpu_to_host GPU_BUFFER_BYTES -> HOST_BYTES mode=copy preserves=value requires=WEBGPU}

--- commissioning backends ---
@{backend CPU_WASM64 status=READY-CONTRACT capabilities=COMPUTE accepts=WASM_LINEAR_BYTES produces=WASM_LINEAR_BYTES modes=copy effects=none probes=wasm64_instantiate,wasm64_known_answer recipe=R_WASM64_RELAY lifecycle=READY,ACTIVE,CLOSED failures=TRANSIENT_OPERATION_FAILURE,PERMANENT_FOR_EPOCH}
@{authority_link CPU_WASM64 "https://doc.rust-lang.org/rustc/platform-support/wasm64-unknown-unknown.html"}
@{authority_link CPU_WASM64 "https://webassembly.github.io/spec/core/text/types.html#text-addrtype"}
@{authority_link CPU_WASM64 "https://webassembly.github.io/spec/js-api/#memories"}
@{backend WEBGPU status=READY-CONTRACT capabilities=GPU_COMPUTE accepts=GPU_BUFFER_BYTES produces=GPU_BUFFER_BYTES modes=copy effects=none probes=webgpu_adapter,webgpu_device,webgpu_known_answer recipe=R_WEBGPU_RELAY lifecycle=UNAVAILABLE,DISCOVERED,REQUESTING,READY,ACTIVE,LOST,CLOSED failures=NOT_ADMITTED,RESOURCE_LOST,PERMANENT_FOR_EPOCH}
@{authority_link WEBGPU "https://gpuweb.github.io/gpuweb/#dom-gpu-requestadapter"}
@{authority_link WEBGPU "https://gpuweb.github.io/gpuweb/#dom-gpuadapter-requestdevice"}
@{authority_link WEBGPU "https://gpuweb.github.io/gpuweb/#dom-gpudevice-lost"}
@{authority_link WEBGPU "https://gpuweb.github.io/gpuweb/#dom-gpudevice-destroy"}

--- codegen recipes (CODEGEN-BUNDLE-CONTRACT.md) ---
@{recipe R_WASM64_RELAY backend=CPU_WASM64 roles=wasm_module,host_adapter exports=memory,abi_version,copy_bytes,region_in,region_out,region_capacity imports=none adapter=wasm64_relay}
@{recipe R_WEBGPU_RELAY backend=WEBGPU roles=host_adapter exports=none imports=none adapter=webgpu_relay}

--- every other capability family of G (CAPABILITY-MATRIX.md): present, not materialized ---
